## Fluxo carrinho abandonado (Kirvano)

Arquivo: `app/Controllers/Http/V2/Reiflick/abandonedCart.js`

```javascript
const {
  sendAbandonedCartMessage,
  normalizePhoneNumber,
} = require("../multchats/wabaMultchats");

// payload.event === "ABANDONED_CART"
const whatsappResult = await sendAbandonedCartMessage(payload);
// whatsappResult: { phoneNumber, templateId, params, multchatsResponse }
```

Persistir no Mongo (`kirvano_abandoned_cart_webhooks`) com metadados do envio.

