## Referência rápida cURL

### Template compra

```bash
curl -X POST "https://api.multchats.com/v2/message/send-message" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer 019e806c-12e3-7bf8-a54d-73287b728c46" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "integrationId": "cmpxg4255004y14i7tzuh3b90",
    "phoneNumber": "5511999999999",
    "message": {
      "type": "template",
      "template": {
        "templateId": "1528932175630070",
        "params": {
          "bodyText": {
            "param_1": "Maria",
            "param_2": "compra"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }'
```

### Template carrinho

```bash
curl -X POST "https://api.multchats.com/v2/message/send-message" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer 019e806c-12e3-7bf8-a54d-73287b728c46" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "integrationId": "cmpxg4255004y14i7tzuh3b90",
    "phoneNumber": "5511999999999",
    "message": {
      "type": "template",
      "template": {
        "templateId": "1313925986831411",
        "params": {
